error[RB0304]: `event` in `on name.ended` has no field `value`: only `status`
  --> RB0304-ended-field.road:11:38
   |
11 |     on peer.ended -> B  do log(event.value)
   |                                      ^^^^^
   |
   = help: a peer's end carries only how it ended, `event.status`: not its output, error or defect

error[RB0304]: `event` in `on name.ended` has no field `statu`: only `status`
  --> RB0304-ended-field.road:14:28
   |
14 |     on peer.ended if event.statu == Ended.Done -> C
   |                            ^^^^^
   |
   = help: did you mean `status`?
